  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-856d035a-7fff-e79b-a085-9aba66c59554\">Modern Savage: [Noun] : Incorruptible, uncompromising and unrelenting on a mission to do what is good, healthy and loving.</b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-8eea8f93-7fff-05b7-2dcb-c535eb53d10a\"><span>Savage Snacks are protein-packed bites for the hard-charging, fast-moving, passionate ones. These gluten free protein bites are portable, packable, resealable and ready to take on every Savage adventure. You're just a bite away from crushing the day! Savage Snacks, Be Full Stay Hungry!</span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span>GO - Pineapple Coconut</span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-b3815eb3-7fff-d271-7a6f-d77e518ca01e\">Sweet and Tangy Pineapple, Almond and Coconut protein bites dusted with pineapple powder for a classic flavor done with savage style.</b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b>BE - Lemon Poppyseed</b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-6b465687-7fff-31c3-175e-7f45ff1f8e7e\">Luscious lemon, almond and cashew protein bites rolled in a poppyseed blanket for chillin&rsquo; the savage way.</b></b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b><b>HAPPY - Double Chocolate</b></b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b><b><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-e427c8c9-7fff-7728-2d78-e61a5156bca7\">Rich Cacao, chocolate ribbons, almond and cashew protein bites for the daily bliss break every savage deserves.</b></b></b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b><b><b></b></b></b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b><b><b>COMING MAY 2024 -&nbsp;</b></b></b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b><b><b>Churro&nbsp;</b></b></b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b><b><b>Cookie Dough</b></b></b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b><b><b>Peanut Butter</b></b></b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b><span><b><b><b></b></b></b></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n</div>",
